==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Misa Ono & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**7 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

